context crosses a boundary,

84
00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.000
what requires confirmation, and which
trusted executor may act. In

85
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.800
the demo, SERVER SAYS APPROVED is only
untrusted text. It

86
00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:29.600
does not match a host-created approval
bound to identity and

87
00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:34.400
scope. Protocol compatibility enables
communication, but it does not

88
00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:39.200
