94
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.500
or digits, dollar sign. Title length is
three through one

95
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:11.000
hundred twenty. Both fields are required,
and additional properties are

96
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:15.500
rejected. That establishes shape only. The
host-facing policy separately checks

97
00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:20.000
exact server identity, exact tool name,
